Capture and share every heart-pounding, cliff-dropping, thrill-seeking moment on the optically-brilliant Sony Action Cam Wearable Camcorder with built-in Wi-Fi®.&nbsp;
<div><br></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Weighs in at just 3.2 oz. with battery so you can capture your adventures on the mountain, in the water and anywhere else you go for your adrenaline fixes&nbsp;</span><br></li><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Action Cam includes a rugged, waterproof housing with tripod mount; camera is waterproof down to 60m (197 ft.), and is nearly impervious to mud, snow and grime&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Ultra-wide-angle Carl Zeiss® Tessar® F2.8 lens offers amazing optics;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">170° viewing angle ensures it's not just you in the picture but everything around you&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Camera features built-in Wi-Fi, image stabilizer and high-definition recording with 1920 x 1080 at 30 fps and 1280 x 720 at 60 fps
HD Slow 2x and HD Slow 4x lets you slow it all down; ideal for studying and refining form and technique&nbsp;</span><br></li><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Full high definition resolution lets you capture every kicked-up rock and every drop of sweat; capable of 30p recording and playback via HDMI® and compatible HDTV&nbsp;</span><br></li><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Share your footage in a snap via Wi-Fi-enabled mobile phones and tablets running the free PlayMemories Mobile™ application&nbsp;</span><br></li><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Select the clips and the camera will transfer and compress web-optimized movies and photos without a single cable; then share your cuts on the web and social media apps&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Whether you're mountain biking, skiing, skateboarding or surfing, SteadyShot® image stabilization and Active Mode deliver stunningly smooth wide-angle to telephoto video&nbsp;</span><br></li><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Turn on the shake canceling mode for added electronic stability and even smoother video capture&nbsp;</span><br></li><li><span style="font-family: undefined; font-size: 12px;">Sony Action Cam ships with 2 adhesive, quick-connect mounts; optional accessories from Sony (not included) let you mount the Action Cam just about anywhere you can imagine</span><br></li></ul></div>

