productFullDescription:
A great alternative to kayak saddles! The J-cradle design of the Yakima HullRaiser mount works with any kayak, supporting it on its side, which is generally stiffer than the bottom.&nbsp;
<div><br></div><div><ul><li>Accommodates most hull shapes; cradles and protects your kayak with soft pads.<br></li><li>Because kayak is propped up on its side, it leaves more space on your crossbars for another kayak or other gear
Includes heavy-duty straps with padded buckles for secure transport.<br></li><li>Fits round and square bars; fits most factory racks—just add Yakima MightyMounts (sold separately).<br></li><li>Includes straps with padded buckles and bow/stern tie-down straps.<br></li></ul></div>

